lines += ['## Stage 4 — reusable masks, guards and calculations','Source text is instantiated through complete expression slots, not raw payload returns. At original parameters the slots leave exact source spelling intact. `observed:<source>` and `method:<source>` use the same source-specific masks and complete historical bank. The observed profile preserves missing attribute presence and malformed raw prompt; all observed profiles are conservatively evidence-only. Normal method profiles fill only the two absent correct references/solutions, and remove only the proved stray $$ in q-103814. Historical subset banks require no numerical-bank repair.','| Mask | Slots and finite normal bounds | Invariant truth subset |','|---|---|---|','| q-42912 | Point x=kπ, nonzero signed integer |k|≤15; y=±1; range probe ±2..±4 | I,II,III |','| q-65310 | Only the zero-claim angle kπ/2, odd signed |k|≤19. The separate general -1 claim is protected | I,III |','| q-103811 | Alleged asymptote odd kπ/2, |k|≤19; distinct even shifts pπ,qπ, 0<|p|,|q|≤12 | III |','| q-103814 | Nonzero integer asymptote kπ, |k|≤19; matched sign ±1 and ±π/2+2nπ | II,III |','| q-65307 | Alleged asymptote odd kπ/2, |k|≤19 | III |','| q-65308 | Period shift even kπ, 0<|k|≤12; domain probe nonzero integer dπ, |d|≤15; solution substitution n=k/2 | II |','| q-103812 | Domain probe nonzero integer kπ, |k|≤15 | none |','The sampler selects template and complete profile first, then its valid parameters. Every explicit call obeys these same guards. Each five-option authored bank is the complete ordered operation family correct truth mask XOR {0,1,2,4,7}, preserving exactly five distinct semantic subsets; the four wrong responses toggle one statement or invert all three. All full response subsets are checked against the actual displayed criteria. Radio choices are shuffled only after the correct identity is computed.','## Finite semantic limits and variety','Easy has 5 global property categories; choose 3 without replacement (10 triples), each of 8 truth orientations: **80** semantic tasks. Hard uses eight nonprincipal signed odd numerators {-11,-9,-7,-5,5,7,9,11}, two claimed ordinates ±1, 28 signed integer asymptote probes and 28 signed half-integer domain probes: **12,544** distinct tested-object tuples. No graph transform occurs.','Moderate distinct displayed assessed objects under these bounds: q-42912 180 (30 x coordinates ×6 range probes; irrelevant y sign excluded); q-65310 20; q-103811 2640 (20 angles ×12×11 distinct ordered shifts); q-103814 76; q-65307 20; q-65308 360; q-103812 30; total **3,326** within source-specific families. These count parameterized objects, not new skills; the finite conceptual categories remain the ones above. The hard numeric catalog has only **8 finite conceptual relation classes** (two actual extremal signs × two claimed signs × two domain-probe integrality states); integer-asymptote recognition is fixed. The 12,544 number tuples are numerical witnesses of those classes, not 12,544 different conceptual skills. Moderate has seven source-specific statement layouts, with ±1 orientation in q-103814; its thousands of objects likewise repeat those finite relations. No variable-letter alias, option permutation, seed, profile alias, or incidental off-domain ordinate is counted. Magnitude/count catalogs are finite design bounds; the largest observed numerator/domain probe is 15 and even shifts include -4 and 6. Signed extensions preserve exactly the same property check.','Mathematical fingerprints omit complete banks/profiles and the incidental ordinate of an off-domain point. Content identity includes actual prompt, solution, level, complete displayed bank and presence. Both are distinct from source IDs.','## Source anomalies and raw-versus-normal denominators','q-42912 and q-65310 each lack a difficulty, solution and correct ref. Original owning MA lesson capture `/home/jake/Developer/MA/DATA/Lessons/3567/Source/3567.json` confirms one five-choice multiple-choice widget each, no captured designation/explanation. Their truths are independently inferred (all three; I and III). Raw API replay omits those attributes. Normal output supplies supported moderate labels and clearly documented authored explanations. No designation match is claimed for these originals.','q-103814 decoded prompt contains trailing literal dollars with character codes [36,36] after its first bullet. It is an unmatched display opener, not a TeX escape issue. Normal output removes those two dollars. All seven decoded prompts have zero adjacent backslash pairs; there is no claimed backslash repair. Raw original prompt remains available publicly as evidence. Source-basis fidelity: 7/7 exact prompts, 7/7 banks, 35/35 values, 5/5 extant solutions, 5/5 extant designations; normal original-parameter prompts exact 6/7, presentation-normalized 7/7; original worked solutions remain exact 5/5.','No mathematically incorrect source teaching rule found. Original minor grammar/typos and invisible function-application character are preserved. Raw evidence profiles are ineligible for learner practice, including the malformed prompt, and grading them cannot establish formatting correctness.']
